{"unit_id":"GHOOOME__dsh-task-pet#card-zh","repo":"GHOOOME/dsh-task-pet","commit":"a24682c1a1411a742ff60e0897af8d5e88e58567","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-task-pet 是供 DSH Web 客户端使用的桌面任务状态宠物。Host 插件监听会话事件并把任务状态通过本机回环桥接给原生宠物窗口，同时提供设置页。它能展示待机、思考、工具执行、回答、完成、出错和中断状态，以及工具名称、耗时和待办进度；用户可更换像素角色、配置状态动效、缩放桌面宠物并调整完成提示。适合希望在桌面上直观看到 DSH 任务进展并个性化宠物外观的用户。原生宠物要求 Apple Silicon 的 macOS，角色和显示选项可在设置页调整。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:101-107","index.js:139-157","index.js:174-208","pet/main.swift:96-130","client.js:1-22"]}
{"unit_id":"GHOOOME__dsh-task-pet#card-en","repo":"GHOOOME/dsh-task-pet","commit":"a24682c1a1411a742ff60e0897af8d5e88e58567","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"A desktop pet for DSH that reflects session events. It shows thinking, tool use, responses, completion, errors, and interruptions, with tool names, elapsed time, and todo progress. Users can choose pixel characters and adjust animation, size, and completion notices. Requires Apple Silicon macOS.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:101-107","index.js:139-157","index.js:174-208","pet/main.swift:96-130","client.js:1-22"]}
